Fixed and published. Flow 1: Driver Application Intake is now live at version 131.

What was wrong & what was fixed

The "email found" branch had 4 DATA_STORE_UPDATE nodes all using:

=variables.resolvedRecordEmail.existingKey

This key expression was returning undefined because records[0].key wasn't resolving correctly from the search result — causing every re-applicant (someone whose email already existed in the data store) to fail.

All 4 affected nodes were fixed to use the direct, reliable key:

=variables.agentResponse.extractedData.email

